{
  "id": "nn_mru51u0x_9v6wa8j6w",
  "title": "LINKEDLIST ",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 data-end=\"126\" data-start=\"98\" data-section-id=\"bx82qe\">Linked List – Introduction</h1>\n<h2 data-end=\"153\" data-start=\"128\" data-section-id=\"6lf2g\">What is a Linked List?</h2>\n<p data-end=\"225\" data-start=\"155\">A <strong data-end=\"172\" data-start=\"157\">Linked List</strong> is a <strong data-end=\"203\" data-start=\"178\">linear data structure</strong> made up of <strong data-end=\"224\" data-start=\"215\">nodes</strong>.</p>\n<p data-end=\"257\" data-start=\"227\">Each <strong data-end=\"240\" data-start=\"232\">node</strong> has <strong data-end=\"256\" data-start=\"245\">2 parts</strong>:</p>\n<ol data-end=\"348\" data-start=\"258\">\n<li data-end=\"289\" data-start=\"258\" data-section-id=\"1v78eug\">\n<strong data-end=\"269\" data-start=\"261\">Data</strong> → stores the value.\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"348\" data-start=\"290\" data-section-id=\"eo3cml\">\n<strong data-end=\"309\" data-start=\"293\">Next pointer</strong> → stores the address of the next node.\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-end=\"358\" data-start=\"350\">Example:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"473\" data-start=\"360\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-css\">Head\n ↓\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-attr\">[2|•]</span> → <span class=\"hljs-selector-attr\">[5|•]</span> → <span class=\"hljs-selector-attr\">[8|•]</span> → <span class=\"hljs-selector-attr\">[7|NULL]</span>\n                              ↑\n                            Tail</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<ul data-end=\"588\" data-start=\"475\">\n<li data-end=\"499\" data-start=\"475\" data-section-id=\"16ksx1l\">\n<strong data-end=\"485\" data-start=\"477\">Head</strong> = First node.\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"523\" data-start=\"500\" data-section-id=\"1rm317l\">\n<strong data-end=\"510\" data-start=\"502\">Tail</strong> = Last node.\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"588\" data-start=\"524\" data-section-id=\"tg6hnv\">\nTail's next pointer is <strong data-end=\"557\" data-start=\"549\">NULL</strong> because there is no next node.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-end=\"593\" data-start=\"590\">\n<h1 data-end=\"625\" data-start=\"595\" data-section-id=\"k7rxzw\">Why do we need Linked Lists?</h1>\n<p data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"627\">Suppose you're storing cars entering a parking lot.</p>\n<ul data-end=\"735\" data-start=\"680\">\n<li data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"680\" data-section-id=\"81gxav\">\nToday: 10 cars\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"716\" data-start=\"697\" data-section-id=\"10sw7h3\">\nTomorrow: 25 cars\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"735\" data-start=\"717\" data-section-id=\"13tj7wd\">\nNext day: 7 cars\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"737\">The size keeps changing.</p>\n<p data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"763\">An <strong data-end=\"775\" data-start=\"766\">array</strong> has a fixed size, so it is not suitable when the number of elements changes frequently.</p>\n<p data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"865\">A <strong data-end=\"882\" data-start=\"867\">Linked List</strong> grows and shrinks dynamically. , yet too vector bhi</p><p data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"865\"><br></p><p data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"865\">\n\nBecause although <code data-end=\"1977\" data-start=\"1969\">vector</code> can grow dynamically, <strong data-end=\"2056\" data-start=\"2000\">insertions and deletions in the middle are expensive</strong>.\n\n<br></p>\n<hr data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"915\">\n<h1 data-end=\"942\" data-start=\"920\" data-section-id=\"162fzt\">Array vs Linked List</h1>\n<div><div tabindex=\"-1\"><table data-end=\"1257\" data-start=\"944\"><thead data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"944\"><tr data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"944\"><th data-col-size=\"md\" data-end=\"952\" data-start=\"944\">Array</th><th data-col-size=\"md\" data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"952\">Linked List</th></tr></thead><tbody data-end=\"1257\" data-start=\"993\"><tr data-end=\"1022\" data-start=\"993\"><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-end=\"1006\" data-start=\"993\">Fixed size</td><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-end=\"1022\" data-start=\"1006\">Dynamic size</td></tr><tr data-end=\"1105\" data-start=\"1023\"><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"1023\">Elements stored together (contiguous memory)</td><td data-end=\"1105\" data-start=\"1070\" data-col-size=\"md\">Nodes stored anywhere in memory</td></tr><tr data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1106\"><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1106\">Fast random access using index</td><td data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1139\" data-col-size=\"md\">Sequential access only</td></tr><tr data-end=\"1257\" data-start=\"1166\"><td data-col-size=\"md\" data-end=\"1197\" data-start=\"1166\">Insertion/deletion is costly</td><td data-end=\"1257\" data-start=\"1197\" data-col-size=\"md\">Insertion/deletion is easy (after reaching the position)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p data-end=\"1458\" data-start=\"1259\"><strong data-end=\"1273\" data-start=\"1259\">Important:</strong><br data-end=\"1276\" data-start=\"1273\">\nArrays need continuous (contiguous) memory. If the next memory block isn't free, the array cannot grow. Linked lists don't have this problem because each node can be stored anywhere.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"1463\" data-start=\"1460\">\n<h1 data-end=\"1486\" data-start=\"1465\" data-section-id=\"1izqq6z\">Structure of a Node</h1>\n<p data-end=\"1507\" data-start=\"1488\">Each node contains:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"1562\" data-start=\"1509\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-kotlin\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Node</span> {\n    int <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">data</span>;\n    Node* next;\n};</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<ul data-end=\"1625\" data-start=\"1564\">\n<li data-end=\"1588\" data-start=\"1564\" data-section-id=\"1dxhdp0\">\n<code data-end=\"1572\" data-start=\"1566\">data</code> → value stored.\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"1625\" data-start=\"1589\" data-section-id=\"kpof02\">\n<code data-end=\"1597\" data-start=\"1591\">next</code> → address of the next node.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-end=\"1630\" data-start=\"1627\">\n<h1 data-end=\"1646\" data-start=\"1632\" data-section-id=\"jrwxi5\">Constructors</h1>\n<h3 data-end=\"1665\" data-start=\"1648\" data-section-id=\"1xik8pr\">Constructor 1</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"1706\" data-start=\"1667\"><div><div><div><div><div class=\"relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div><div><div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-scss\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">Node</span>(int data1, Node* next1)</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"1728\" data-start=\"1708\">Creates a node with:</p>\n<ul data-end=\"1762\" data-start=\"1729\">\n<li data-end=\"1745\" data-start=\"1729\" data-section-id=\"aehqys\">\ndata = <code data-end=\"1745\" data-start=\"1738\">data1</code>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"1762\" data-start=\"1746\" data-section-id=\"kydetg\">\nnext = <code data-end=\"1762\" data-start=\"1755\">next1</code>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"1772\" data-start=\"1764\">Example:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"1817\" data-start=\"1774\"><div><div><div><div><div class=\"relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div><div><div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-cpp\">Node* a = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">Node</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>, <span class=\"hljs-literal\">nullptr</span>);</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<hr data-end=\"1822\" data-start=\"1819\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1841\" data-start=\"1824\" data-section-id=\"1xik8po\">Constructor 2</h3>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"1869\" data-start=\"1843\"><div><div><div><div><div class=\"relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div><div><div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-scss\"><span class=\"hljs-built_in\">Node</span>(int data1)</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"1891\" data-start=\"1871\">Creates a node with:</p>\n<ul data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1892\">\n<li data-end=\"1908\" data-start=\"1892\" data-section-id=\"aehqys\">\ndata = <code data-end=\"1908\" data-start=\"1901\">data1</code>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1909\" data-section-id=\"18yf41r\">\nnext = <code data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1918\">nullptr</code>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"1937\" data-start=\"1929\">Example:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"1973\" data-start=\"1939\"><div><div><div><div><div class=\"relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div><div><div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-cpp\">Node* a = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">Node</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span>);</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"1988\" data-start=\"1975\">Equivalent to</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"2027\" data-start=\"1990\"><div><div><div><div><div class=\"relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div><div><div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-ini\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">data</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">10</span><span class=\"hljs-comment\">;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-attr\">next</span> = nullptr<span class=\"hljs-comment\">;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<hr data-end=\"2032\" data-start=\"2029\">\n<h1 data-end=\"2051\" data-start=\"2034\" data-section-id=\"2lgfwm\">Creating a Node</h1>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"2091\" data-start=\"2053\"><div><div><div><div><div class=\"relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div><div><div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-cpp\">Node* y = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">Node</span>(arr[<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>]);</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"2106\" data-start=\"2093\">What happens?</p>\n<ol data-end=\"2249\" data-start=\"2108\">\n<li data-end=\"2146\" data-start=\"2108\" data-section-id=\"1nyern\">\n<code data-end=\"2116\" data-start=\"2111\">new</code> allocates memory on the heap.\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"2168\" data-start=\"2147\" data-section-id=\"9p5yuk\">\nA node is created.\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"2188\" data-start=\"2169\" data-section-id=\"1xrigr0\">\n<code data-end=\"2187\" data-start=\"2172\">data = arr[0]</code>.\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"2209\" data-start=\"2189\" data-section-id=\"1li6t9i\">\n<code data-end=\"2208\" data-start=\"2192\">next = nullptr</code>.\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"2249\" data-start=\"2210\" data-section-id=\"15ndoru\">\n<code data-end=\"2216\" data-start=\"2213\">y</code> stores the address of that node.\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-end=\"2259\" data-start=\"2251\">Example:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"2332\" data-start=\"2261\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-lua\">y\n │\n ▼\n+<span class=\"hljs-comment\">-----------+</span>\n| data = <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>  |\n| <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">next</span>=NULL |\n+<span class=\"hljs-comment\">-----------+</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<hr data-end=\"2337\" data-start=\"2334\">\n<h1 data-end=\"2363\" data-start=\"2339\" data-section-id=\"ymimi2\">Understanding Pointers</h1>\n<p data-end=\"2439\" data-start=\"2365\">A <strong data-end=\"2378\" data-start=\"2367\">pointer</strong> stores the <strong data-end=\"2408\" data-start=\"2390\">memory address</strong> of another variable or object.</p>\n<p data-end=\"2449\" data-start=\"2441\">Example:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"2466\" data-start=\"2451\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-css\">Node* <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">p</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"2473\" data-start=\"2468\">means</p>\n<blockquote data-end=\"2512\" data-start=\"2475\">\n<p data-end=\"2512\" data-start=\"2477\">\"<code data-end=\"2481\" data-start=\"2478\">p</code> stores the address of a Node.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p data-end=\"2552\" data-start=\"2514\">It does <strong data-end=\"2529\" data-start=\"2522\">not</strong> store the node itself.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"2557\" data-start=\"2554\">\n<h1 data-end=\"2574\" data-start=\"2559\" data-section-id=\"1crr2a1\">Node vs Node*</h1>\n<h3 data-end=\"2586\" data-start=\"2576\" data-section-id=\"1350hwm\"><code data-end=\"2586\" data-start=\"2580\">Node</code></h3>\n<p data-end=\"2615\" data-start=\"2588\">Represents the actual node.</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"2632\" data-start=\"2617\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-undefined\">Node x;</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"2650\" data-start=\"2634\">Memory contains:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"2709\" data-start=\"2652\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-lua\">x\n+<span class=\"hljs-comment\">------------+</span>\n| data |\n| <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">next</span> |\n+<span class=\"hljs-comment\">------------+</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<hr data-end=\"2714\" data-start=\"2711\">\n<h3 data-end=\"2727\" data-start=\"2716\" data-section-id=\"d1fh1o\"><code data-end=\"2727\" data-start=\"2720\">Node*</code></h3>\n<p data-end=\"2750\" data-start=\"2729\">Represents a pointer.</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"2768\" data-start=\"2752\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-css\">Node* <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">p</span>;</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"2791\" data-start=\"2770\">Memory contains only:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"2844\" data-start=\"2793\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-diff\">p\n<span class=\"hljs-addition\">+------------+</span>\n| address |\n<span class=\"hljs-addition\">+------------+</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"2866\" data-start=\"2846\">It points to a node.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"2871\" data-start=\"2868\">\n<h1 data-end=\"2892\" data-start=\"2873\" data-section-id=\"1cerblt\">Accessing Members</h1>\n<p data-end=\"2914\" data-start=\"2894\">If <code data-end=\"2900\" data-start=\"2897\">y</code> is a pointer,</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"2934\" data-start=\"2916\"><div><div><div><div><div class=\"relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div><div><div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-kotlin\">y-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">data</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"2941\" data-start=\"2936\">means</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"2960\" data-start=\"2943\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-kotlin\">(*y).<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">data</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"3019\" data-start=\"2962\">Access the data stored inside the node pointed to by <code data-end=\"3018\" data-start=\"3015\">y</code>.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"3024\" data-start=\"3021\">\n<h1 data-end=\"3042\" data-start=\"3026\" data-section-id=\"1ul5h9c\">Why use <code data-end=\"3041\" data-start=\"3036\">new</code>?</h1>\n<p data-end=\"3058\" data-start=\"3044\">Without <code data-end=\"3057\" data-start=\"3052\">new</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"3078\" data-start=\"3060\"><div><div><div><div><div class=\"relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div><div><div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-undefined\">Node x;</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"3111\" data-start=\"3080\">Memory is created on the stack.</p>\n<p data-end=\"3117\" data-start=\"3113\">With</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"3152\" data-start=\"3119\"><div><div><div><div><div class=\"relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div><div><div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-cpp\">Node* x = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">Node</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>);</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"3214\" data-start=\"3154\">Memory is created on the heap and stays until you delete it.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"3219\" data-start=\"3216\">\n<h1 data-end=\"3234\" data-start=\"3221\" data-section-id=\"1kf5g2o\">Memory Used</h1>\n<p data-end=\"3253\" data-start=\"3236\">Each node stores:</p>\n<ul data-end=\"3271\" data-start=\"3255\">\n<li data-end=\"3261\" data-start=\"3255\" data-section-id=\"1j40n88\">\nData\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"3271\" data-start=\"3262\" data-section-id=\"ugmss3\">\nPointer\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"3296\" data-start=\"3273\">Assuming data is <code data-end=\"3295\" data-start=\"3290\">int</code>:</p>\n<h3 data-end=\"3315\" data-start=\"3298\" data-section-id=\"1l4v29c\">32-bit System</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"3352\" data-start=\"3317\">\n<li data-end=\"3332\" data-start=\"3317\" data-section-id=\"16m5hn\">\nint = 4 bytes\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"3352\" data-start=\"3333\" data-section-id=\"z75rnn\">\npointer = 4 bytes\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"3373\" data-start=\"3354\">Total = <strong data-end=\"3373\" data-start=\"3362\">8 bytes</strong></p>\n<hr data-end=\"3378\" data-start=\"3375\">\n<h3 data-end=\"3397\" data-start=\"3380\" data-section-id=\"1bnzm2b\">64-bit System</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"3434\" data-start=\"3399\">\n<li data-end=\"3414\" data-start=\"3399\" data-section-id=\"16m5hn\">\nint = 4 bytes\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"3434\" data-start=\"3415\" data-section-id=\"kszej3\">\npointer = 8 bytes\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"3475\" data-start=\"3436\">Total = <strong data-end=\"3456\" data-start=\"3444\">12 bytes</strong> (ignoring padding)</p>\n<p data-end=\"3568\" data-start=\"3477\">So linked lists use <strong data-end=\"3512\" data-start=\"3497\">more memory</strong> than arrays because every node stores an extra pointer.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"3573\" data-start=\"3570\">\n<h1 data-end=\"3589\" data-start=\"3575\" data-section-id=\"c3mln3\">Applications</h1>\n<p data-end=\"3616\" data-start=\"3591\">Linked Lists are used in:</p>\n<ul data-end=\"3786\" data-start=\"3618\">\n<li data-end=\"3643\" data-start=\"3618\" data-section-id=\"1c4on3u\">\nImplementing <strong data-end=\"3643\" data-start=\"3633\">Stacks</strong>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"3669\" data-start=\"3644\" data-section-id=\"1hbc8kl\">\nImplementing <strong data-end=\"3669\" data-start=\"3659\">Queues</strong>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"3701\" data-start=\"3670\" data-section-id=\"xckjw\">\n<strong data-end=\"3701\" data-start=\"3672\">Dynamic memory allocation</strong>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"3749\" data-start=\"3702\" data-section-id=\"1yl91hu\">\n<strong data-end=\"3723\" data-start=\"3704\">Browser history</strong> (Back/Forward navigation)\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"3786\" data-start=\"3750\" data-section-id=\"opkws4\">\nMany other dynamic data structures\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-end=\"3791\" data-start=\"3788\">\n<h1 data-end=\"3816\" data-start=\"3793\" data-section-id=\"1k6r9x0\">Types of Linked Lists</h1>\n<h2 data-end=\"3842\" data-start=\"3818\" data-section-id=\"qurulb\">1. Singly Linked List</h2>\n<p data-end=\"3883\" data-start=\"3844\">Each node points to the next node only.</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"3909\" data-start=\"3885\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-cpp\"><span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> → <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span> → <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span> → <span class=\"hljs-literal\">NULL</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"3941\" data-start=\"3911\">Traversal is only <strong data-end=\"3940\" data-start=\"3929\">forward</strong>.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"3946\" data-start=\"3943\">\n<h2 data-end=\"3972\" data-start=\"3948\" data-section-id=\"1b99z2r\">2. Doubly Linked List</h2>\n<p data-end=\"3991\" data-start=\"3974\">Each node stores:</p>\n<ul data-end=\"4033\" data-start=\"3993\">\n<li data-end=\"4011\" data-start=\"3993\" data-section-id=\"nfkeua\">\nPrevious pointer\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"4018\" data-start=\"4012\" data-section-id=\"1j40n88\">\nData\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"4033\" data-start=\"4019\" data-section-id=\"195mevo\">\nNext pointer\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"4066\" data-start=\"4035\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-cpp\"><span class=\"hljs-literal\">NULL</span> ← <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span> ⇄ <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span> ⇄ <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span> → <span class=\"hljs-literal\">NULL</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"4106\" data-start=\"4068\">Traversal is <strong data-end=\"4105\" data-start=\"4081\">forward and backward</strong>.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"4111\" data-start=\"4108\">\n<h2 data-end=\"4139\" data-start=\"4113\" data-section-id=\"b9fax6\">3. Circular Linked List</h2>\n<p data-end=\"4185\" data-start=\"4141\">The last node points back to the first node.</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre data-end=\"4224\" data-start=\"4187\"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback\"><div></div><div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"code-block-viewer\"><div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\"><button class=\"copy-code-btn\">Copy</button><pre><code contenteditable=\"true\" data-highlighted=\"yes\" class=\"hljs language-undefined\">1 → 2 → 3\n↑       ↓\n└───────┘</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre></div>\n<p data-end=\"4256\" data-start=\"4226\">There is no <code data-end=\"4244\" data-start=\"4238\">NULL</code> at the end.</p>\n\n\n",
